{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\uc601\uc5b4\ub77c\uc8fd__1_.gif?t=1745554388\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\ub180\ub78c_\ub9ac\uc5bc.gif?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mentor, like family, has been murdered.<br>Her last words\u2014<strong>&quot;Kill La.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As \u2018Valhalla,\u2019 you must uncover the true <strong>\u2018La\u2019</strong> who killed your mentor and take revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Mysterious Island That Grants Wishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\ucd08\ub300\uc7a5_\uc6a9\ub7c9\ub2e4\uc6b4.gif?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chasing the clues behind your mentor\u2019s death, you arrive at a peculiar island.<br>Everyone here has followed an <strong>&quot;invitation that grants wishes.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/island.gif?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this island has only one rule:<br>\u203b <strong>Never wander at night.</strong> \u203b<br>Uncover the hidden truth of this island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deduce Within Delusions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\uae30\uc5b5\uc758\ubc29_\uc218\uc815.gif?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through <strong>\u2018Resonance,\u2019</strong> you can enter the memories of suspects.<br>Observe their past and extract the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/dream.gif?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the clues you\u2019ve gathered <strong>within dreams</strong><br>and find the true culprit behind your mentor\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Brutal Yet Beautiful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c_en__1_.png?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Converse with <strong>eight \u2018La\u2019s\u2019</strong>, build rapport, and gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\ub77c\ud30c\uc5d8\ub77c_\uc2dc\uacc4.gif?t=1745554388\" />But never forget\u2014<strong>they cannot be trusted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Your goal is singular\u2014revenge.</strong><br>Find the real \u2018La\u2019 and decide how this story ends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2524200?t=1745554388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745554388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/9ef5c956c9d221ba1dd4b80cd1a2b9810cb70c7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745554388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/9ef5c956c9d221ba1dd4b80cd1a2b9810cb70c7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745554388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Suicide, Blood and Cruel Description"},"demos":[{"appid":2601570,"description":""