<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/dream.gif?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the clues you\u2019ve gathered <strong>within dreams</strong><br>and find the true culprit behind your mentor\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Brutal Yet Beautiful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c_en__1_.png?t=1745554388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Converse with <strong>eight \u2018La\u2019s\u2019</strong>, build rapport, and gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/\ub77c\ud30c\uc5d8\ub77c_\uc2dc\uacc4.gif?t=1745554388\" />But never forget\u2014<strong>they cannot be trusted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Your goal is singular\u2014revenge.</strong><br>Find the real \u2018La\u2019 and decide how this story ends.</p>","developers":["Black Tangerine"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/header.jpg?t=1745554388","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257076078,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076078/movie480.mp4?t=1738333250","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076078/movie_max.mp4?t=1738333250"},"name":"new_pv_teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076078/59fe305c6b417b683b0eca71732c436d96cfd3bd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738333250","webm":{"480":"http://vi